{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny","id":1356011,"title":"Elegant Meditation on the Nature of Big Sunny ****","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-19T23:52:43-08:00","id":1356011,"title":"Elegant Meditation on the Nature of Big Sunny ****","content":"<br /> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/481568210043273237/657323481540591657/image0.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> I have lots of Exalted things in my head that I need to let out and this will be the thread for it \u2229( \u30fb\u03c9\u30fb)\u2229. I hope that I'll manage to have one doodle for each post ~<br /> <br /> And the questions for today (which spurns the thread's title) is the UCS's genital size!<br /> <br /> It's very possible that he has a small one considering his inspiration of the Greco-Roman deity, Sol Invictus. In the Greco-Roman cultural sphere, a small phallus is considered to be a mark of beauty and thus it's logical that our own UCS would possess such small size since he's the most beautiful man in Creation (after Demetheus of course).<br /> <br /> And if the Sun has a small phallus then Luna would instead have a very large one, since Luna is the name of the Roman's moon goddess, and a large (and erect) penis in the ancient Mediterranean is reserved for those who are ruled by instinct and emotion such as half-beasts and barbarians, all of which are Exalted Luna's themes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T03:30:01-08:00","id":1356030,"title":"","content":"Consider the statue of David by Michelangelo. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800080\">I express my opinions, but YSMV; Your Stories May Vary.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><i>Formerly known as wyrmpuff</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12288-mal-akh","name":"Mal'akh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12288_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T05:23:20-08:00","id":1356054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mal'akh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny?p=1356030#post1356030\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Consider the statue of David by Michelangelo. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /