Sadly, Goliath <i>is</i> described as wearing armor. :-(","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T06:12:35-08:00","id":1356071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny?p=1356066#post1356066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sadly, Goliath <i>is</i> described as wearing armor. :-(</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Maybe it was just a breastplate. A shirtless, skirtless breastplate :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","name":"Clophiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T06:20:46-08:00","id":1356073,"title":"","content":"We know Concy can shape-change. I kinda picture his human form like a Ken-doll: he doesn't need a penis, his form is perfect, why would a perfect form have something so superfluous?<br /> <br /> The infinite armed Dragon-King form has infinite barbed lizard penes. Which is partly what makes him so terrifying. Just think of Little Beam's poor mother.<br /> <br /> But I like the idea of little dick sun, big dick moon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T06:43:28-08:00","id":1356081,"title":"","content":"Is this really something that should be discussed in a forum? If this were the first topic I'd stumble across as a new user...<br /> Like would this be less appropriate if the topic were about the vaginal depth or cup size of various Exalted characters?<br /> I don't personally mind all that much but I do think it's certainly a...weird topic. <br /> <br /> As to not have this comment be purely meta commentary: I think going with Greco-Roman cultural concepts is alright and that's about as far as that discussion should go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11711-musclewizard","name":"Musclewizard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T08:00:16-08:00","id":1356100,"title":"","content":"I don't know about size, but I'm pretty sure Oricalcum is called that for a reason if you catch my meaning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T08:09:24-08:00","id":1356102,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Musclewizard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny?p=1356081#post1356081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is this really something that should be discussed in a forum? If this were the first topic I'd stumble across as a new user...</div> </div> </div> </div>In the game where the most iconic demon is a prostitute and the PCs can start with the supra-human ability to have sex for three minutes straight?<br /> <br /> I think we're good.<br /> <br /> That said, I wouldn't want anyone to be upset about this topic. I couldn't work out what a Big Sunny **** was until after I'd clicked on the topic. Be nice to have NSFW in the topic title or something. As I am, you know, at work (ah the benefits of being head of IT).<br /> <br /> I'm sure this thread gives a better impression of us than <b>F<span style=\"font-size:24px\">IV</span>E YE<span style=\"font-size:24px\">E</span><span style=\"font-size:28px\">EAA<span style=\"font-size:36px\">AR</span>RRS</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">S</span>S ! ! !</b><br /> <br /> But it looks like the Greco-Romans have it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T08:18:33-08:00","id":1356103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny?p=1356066#post1356066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sadly, Goliath <i>is</i> described as wearing armor. :-(</div> </div> </div> </div>And David is described as being completely unimpressed and unafraid of Goliath, but the statue is already reinterpreting the story, so Goliath might as well be letting it all hang out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T14:00:40-08:00","id":1356160,"title":"","content":"What on earth makes you think he just has <i>one</i>?<br /> <br /> Dude has four arms. You do the math.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T15:33:12-08:00","id":1356182,"title":"","content":"As the ultimate champion of everything, I feel like the answer is &quot;bigger than yours.&quot; Of course, given their shapeshifting abilities and general attitude, I suspect the same answer holds for Luna.<br /> <br /> This inherent contradiction has fascinated generations of Sidereal philosophers. At least until one of the Maidens catches them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T20:12:24-08:00","id":1356223,"title":"","content":"The Highest of Holies' genital size is [sealed by the <span style=\"color:#008000\">Maiden of Secrets</span> and the <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Maiden of Serenity</span>]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800080\">I express my opinions, but YSMV; Your Stories May Vary.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><i>Formerly known as wyrmpuff</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12288-mal-akh","name":"Mal'akh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12288_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-20T21:26:17-08:00","id":1356233,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aquillion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny?p=1356160#post1356160\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What on earth makes you think he just has <i>one</i>?</div> </div> </div> </div>Somehow I'm terrified and strangely aroused at the same time (\u00b4\u03c9\uff40)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grod_the_giant</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny?p=1356182#post1356182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As the ultimate champion of everything, I feel like the answer is &quot;bigger than yours.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Bigger is better&quot; seems to be a pretty modern concept I think, which feels strange to apply to an ancient Greco-Roman deity. Plus he's the patron of supreme human skills, so I think it's more fitting that his phallus is small yet he's extremely skillful at the art of love.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-21T12:28:32-08:00","id":1356346,"title":"","content":"Regardless of its size, it is undoubtedly perfect.<br /> <br /> Luna is the ultimate shapeshifter and apparently genderfluid; Luna's form is whatever they want it to be, and I doubt they have a single default male form with a defined genital size. Their dick, when they decide to have one, is whatever they want it to be at the moment.<br /> <br /> Hiparkes, on the other hand, is probably hung like a horse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-21T16:03:28-08:00","id":1356387,"title":"","content":"I'm gonna go with distinctive, but not to a stylized or exaggerated extreme. Sufficient to get the job done.<br /> <br /> As Luna goes, I think there's still value in the idea from Glories that the true form is of a humanoid figure wrapped in a cloak of night whose bodily features are in a constant state of flux. Luna assumes masculine forms as they please, but the parameters for the phallus are not pinned to a single priority or meaning, and take on the whole range, although I imagine that when presenting either gender Luna will often have a priority to assume exaggerated sexual features.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Musclewizard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny?p=1356081#post1356081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't personally mind all that much but I do think it's certainly a...weird topic.</div> </div> </div> </div>New users require introduction to Jen threads.<br /> <br /> More seriously, I actually kind of think that the Incarnae are sufficiently distant and mythic that, so long as it remains within the boundaries of good taste, a bit of objectification is pretty acceptable. Even kind of warranted; I'm thinking in terms of the idea that reproductions of their image are going to be the most likely way that anybody, even most Exalted, interact with them, and that invites some consideration for the aesthetics.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-21T16:56:30-08:00","id":1356400,"title":"","content":"I would like to point out that the UCS has not always resembled a human, but previously was an orichalcum-scaled Dragon King-like being. His true form on the other hand is a roiling mass of dozens of arms wearing molten orichalcum and obsidian blazing with galaxies with supernatural eyes before being forming. As a compromise between the competing views of &quot;The UCS is always bigger/perfect&quot; and &quot;The UCS has a modestly greco-roman size&quot; I propose that over time <i>the UCS has redefined his conception of the perfect penis </i>in accordance with the ideals of the society that had his favor. Given the existence of Ipithymia in Malfeas, the descriptions of Primordial genitalia in Scroll of Swallowed Darkness and what we know of Theion's attitude from Gunstar Autocthonia I think it's not out of the question that at least <b>one </b>of his Primordial makers sated his lusts on the Sun, and would have expected him to not disappoint. <br /> <br /> In other words, the UCS used to have a truly massive penis. It was a nothing short of a cosmic phenomena, likely akin to a stack of galaxies rotating at high speed like the representation of Gilgamesh's Ea in Fate/Extra CCC, which incidentally has a final boss (Kiara Sessyoin) who shows the kind of genitalia the Sun would have likely been expected to satisfy. Later in the Time of Glory it was likely the bifurcated lizard's penis or an alligator's constantly erect one given his draconic form, although more information is needed on the Dragon Kings' genitalia here. Finally during the time of the Solar Deliberative we can conjecture the Sun reduced himself to a more modest size both to avoid intimidating human partners* familiar with his girth, and frankly because at that point he would have had nothing to prove.<br /> <br /> *Well, except Merela evidently","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12360-guitar-longcat","name":"Guitar Longcat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-21T17:02:32-08:00","id":1356401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny?p=1356346#post1356346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Regardless of its size, it is undoubtedly perfect.<br /> <br /> Luna is the ultimate shapeshifter and apparently genderfluid; Luna's form is whatever they want it to be, and I doubt they have a single default male form with a defined genital size. Their dick, when they decide to have one, is whatever they want it to be at the moment.<br /> <br /> Hiparkes, on the other hand, is probably hung like a horse.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering Luna's Cthonic Baara is the result of an evolutionary free-for-all between all her forms, I suspect that even if Luna does not have an objectively superior penis she has invented many new forms of gender and genitals to combine into her super-genitalia. Since she DOES enjoy using massive forms to show off her glory and prowess according to Glories: Luna, I am reminded of the fruit fly's ability to produce sperm larger than it's whole body and the duck's disproportionately long, sharp penis evolved to navigate the labyrinths of female duck genitals-except hidden and/or inverted into her internals as she plays the role of &quot;Madonna&quot; with her partner. <br /> <br /> After a while, it probably all blends together like Ultimate Kars.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12360-guitar-longcat","name":"Guitar Longcat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T09:26:40-08:00","id":1356488,"title":"","content":"Free-form shapeshifting Luna is pretty much an Ex2 thing though, we don't know what they are capable of in Ex3 yet so &quot;Small Sun, Big Moon&quot; is still on the table since it's quite possible for them to have a true form like their Chosen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-22T11:04:01-08:00","id":1356502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny?p=1356233#post1356233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Plus he's the patron of supreme human skills, so I think it's more fitting that his phallus is small yet he's extremely skillful at the art of love.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>To me this idea makes the most sense if he's of average size. Like if it's large you would say &quot;He has a big penis and is extremely skilled at lovemaking&quot; and if it's small you would say &quot;He has a small penis but/and is extremely skilled at lovemaking&quot; but if it's average you would just say &quot;He is extremely skilled at lovemaking&quot;. Certainly different sizes require different skills, and having the average size would mean his skills are the most broadly applicable.<br /> <br /> The same argument would suggest that other aspects of his physical appearance are average, and I think those that aren't so average have special explanations - he is absolutely ripped because muscles are a product of training, and has four arms to show off more skills at once. I'm not sure having multiple penises, as Aquillion suggested, would really let you achieve the same thing...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25834-habitableexoplanet","name":"habitableexoplanet","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"296"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T09:09:49-08:00","id":1356655,"title":"","content":"Argh, I have this cute idea of my Zenith being mistaken for a Full Moon and my Dawn for an Abyssal thanks to their anima (color) and their attire's aesthetic, but apparently Solar anima has a distinctive sunny smell, they also warm thing up while bleaching them white like intensive sunlight so there is no way for onlookers to make such a mistake \u0ca5\ufe4f\u0ca5<br /> <br /> I'm also not really sure what's the deal with the anima color of the 5 Solar castes, does the text mean that you can only choose between those listed colors, or are they just the most common one?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T10:43:46-08:00","id":1356666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1356011-elegant-meditation-on-the-nature-of-big-sunny?p=1356655#post1356655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm also not really sure what's the deal with the anima color of the 5 Solar castes, does the text mean that you can only choose between those listed colors, or are they just the most common one?</div> </div> </div> </div>My understanding is that those colors <i>tend to be</i> featured or are prominent in the anima and/or its imagery. <br /> <br /> So for instance, a Dawn Caste brawler whose iconic anima is a titanic fist of gold slamming into the ground, might have the knuckles red as if with blood. My Twilight Caste artisan\u2019s anima is a depiction of the universe as a tapestry of sunset-colored silken threads, with the connections between realms as gates of golden light.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-23T18:05:23-08:00","id":1356733,"title":"","content":"Anyone still remember Glorious and Saber of the short-lived Glorious Saber? They whose animas where a cat licking itself and the other is an arrow with the words &quot;I'm with stupid&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800080\">I express my opinions, but YSMV; Your Stories May Vary.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><i>Formerly known as wyrmpuff</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12288-mal-akh","name":"Mal'akh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12288_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}